{"id":210,"education_philosophy":null,"history":null,"facilities":null,"feature_summary":"少人数と習熟度別学習で伸ばす山附中","feature_description":"山梨大学教育学部附属中学校は、大学附属として研究的な学びを土台にしながら、少人数での指導や習熟度別の学習を通して基礎と応用を積み上げる学校です。公式案内では学校概要や教育活動、学校生活が整理され、地域と大学に開かれた附属校としての役割が示されています。学校行事や学びの導線も分かりやすく整えられています。学びの様子も追いやすいです。","clubs":[{"id":4663,"name":"野球部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://wgr.yamanashi.ac.jp/introduction/59/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4664,"name":"サッカー部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://wgr.yamanashi.ac.jp/introduction/59/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4665,"name":"陸上競技部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://wgr.yamanashi.ac.jp/introduction/59/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4666,"name":"卓球部男子","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://wgr.yamanashi.ac.jp/introduction/59/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4667,"name":"卓球部女子","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://wgr.yamanashi.ac.jp/introduction/59/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4668,"name":"ソフトテニス部男子","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://wgr.yamanashi.ac.jp/introduction/59/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4669,"name":"ソフトテニス部女子","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://wgr.yamanashi.ac.jp/introduction/59/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4670,"name":"バレーボール部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://wgr.yamanashi.ac.jp/introduction/59/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4671,"name":"バスケットボール部男子","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://wgr.yamanashi.ac.jp/introduction/59/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4672,"name":"バスケットボール部女子","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://wgr.yamanashi.ac.jp/introduction/59/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4673,"name":"剣道部","category":"運動部","source_url":"https://wgr.yamanashi.ac.jp/introduction/59/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4674,"name":"科学部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://wgr.yamanashi.ac.jp/introduction/59/","verified_at":"2026-08-06"},{"id":4675,"name":"吹奏楽部","category":"文化部","source_url":"https://wgr.yamanashi.ac.jp/introduction/59/","